{"id": "EUVD-2026-97663", "enisaUuid": "ccb19e24-b62d-3b49-8630-ea527d094a76", "description": "MONAI 1.2.0 before 1.6.1 contains an insecure deserialization vulnerability in nnUNetV2Runner that unpickles the postprocessing_file path read from inference_information.json without confining it to the results directory. Attackers who can modify inference_information.json can point it at a malicious pickle elsewhere on the filesystem to execute code when predict_ensemble_postprocessing runs.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T16:05:40", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-12T16:05:40", "baseScore": 7.0, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/Project-MONAI/MONAI/security/advisories/GHSA-8f32-8649-rv87", "https://github.com/Project-MONAI/MONAI/commit/08576205c4de3c214976294d1dec8f7b2e78cdb9", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/monai-1.2.0-before-1.6.1-insecure-deserialization-rce-via-nnunetv2runner-postprocessing-file-path"], "aliases": ["GHSA-7hmf-j253-4p2j", "CVE-2026-109361"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.23, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "7407227b-7665-3c56-96fc-31d4ec540741", "product": {"name": "MONAI", "vendor": {"name": "Project-MONAI"}}, "product_version": "1.2.0 <1.6.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "74abc133-f9cb-3006-ab94-ad984f48d8f0", "vendor": {"name": "Project-MONAI"}}], "isExploited": false}